{"chunkId": "f0344942-cbfd-515f-9d78-cf4785f8705f", "text": "重复阅读：多次重复阅读同一学习材料，通过反复接触来加深印象和记忆。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-rereading", "strategyName": "重复阅读", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.9, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.38, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
