{"chunkId": "9d562310-be3b-5b03-8ba3-b1bce649249b", "text": "重复阅读适合初次接触新材料的快速浏览，原因是：第二次阅读通常比第一次带来最多的额外收益。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-rereading", "strategyName": "重复阅读", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.9, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.38, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "初次接触新材料的快速浏览"}}
{"chunkId": "05fa230b-12b3-506b-b9d9-36b7ce22aaf4", "text": "重复阅读不适合需要长期记忆保持的任务，原因是：重复阅读在延时测试中效果极差，间隔练习的效果远优于重复阅读。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-rereading", "strategyName": "重复阅读", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.9, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.38, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要长期记忆保持的任务"}}
{"chunkId": "2f967d3c-94e9-54c1-80fe-21fb0c2efd0d", "text": "重复阅读不适合需要深度理解和分析的任务，原因是：重复阅读不促进深度加工，84%的大学生自报使用此方法，但效果最差。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-rereading", "strategyName": "重复阅读", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.9, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.38, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要深度理解和分析的任务"}}
